      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Link to Deichmans music blog (in Norwegian 🇳🇴) is available &lt;a href=&#34;https://musikk.deichman.no/2024/12/27/deichman-arets-album-2024/#julian&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where do you want to go today? Maybe your brain needs a transcendental head massage, or are you in the nostalgic corner? Do you dare to listen to an album that compulsively and somatically moves you? If that doesn&amp;rsquo;t suit your taste, you can always give your soul a funky spa gift card? All this and your annual dose of micronutrients are here!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
